{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50456","headline":"六八 · 王梵志","name":"六八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"元得地恩重，（「元」，伯三六五六卷作「先」。\n）酬偿勿使轻。\n一湌何所直，感贺百千倾。\n（「百千倾」，斯三三九三卷作「百千金」，伯三七一六卷作「金百倾」，伯三六五六作「百金倾」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50456.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50456","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}